      ***  >>>>>>>>>>  P O R T A B L E    P R O G R A M  <<<<<<<<<<  ***
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      ************************************************************
      **                                                        **
      **       L O A D P O   F O R   A L L   P L A N T S        **
      **                                                        **
      *D   THIS PROGRAM IS FOR ADDING, MODIFING, AND DELETING   **
      *D   PURCHASE ORDERS IN BATCH MODE FROM AN INPUT FILE.    **
      *D   THE DATA COMES FROM CORPORATE PURCHASING IN EITHER   **
      *D   AKRON, CANADA (TORONTO), OR CUMBERLAND (KELLY).      **
      **                                                        **
      ************************************************************


      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *------- NOTE: FOR A PROCESSING OUTLINE OF THIS PROGRAM,
      *------- SORTED LIST OF ERROR MESSAGES, MISC INFORMATION, AND
      *------- PROGRAM CHANGES PREVIOUS TO THE RELEASE SYSTEM, REFER
      *------- TO THE PROGRAM DOCUMENATION FILE 'PLOADPO.DOC.CME'
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *
      *
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  MARCH 19, 1993     CR KALMAN
      *C  AKRON WAS DESIGNATING INVOICELESS PO'S FOR IT'S OWN AKRON RCV'G
      *C  BUT IT ENDED UP SENDING ONE OF THESE PO'S TO ANOTHER PLANT.
      *C  THIS PROGRAM WAS LOADING A "Y" INTO THE INVOICELESS IND FIELD
      *C  FOR THE PO. I CHANGED IT TO LOAD AN "X". THE PLANT ALSO NEEDS
      *C  TO DESIGNATE THE VENDOR AS INVOICELESS IF THEY WANT THE
      *C  PAYMENT TO BE AUTOMATICALLY GENERATED BY TINGEN.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  SEPT. 12, 1994     JE COFFMAN   REQ# 6527
      *C  ADDED CODE TO PICK UP CHAT NUMBERS FROM DVENDITM FOR CODED
      *C  ITEMS THAT WERE QUOTE-GENERATED AND THE USER IS CREATING A
      *C  PURCHASE ORDER FROM THE QUOTE.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  DECEMBER 8, 1994   JS BUNGO
      *C  ADDED NEW PO LOAD TRANSACTION #6 TO MODIFY THE PO ITEM
      *C  ORDERED QUANTITY AND PRICE FROM MEXICO'S IMS (IMPORT
      *C  MANAGEMENT SYSTEM).  PO LOAD FILE WILL CONTAIN THE
      *C  PO NUMBER, ITEM NUMBER, NEW ORDERED QUANTITY, NEW ORDERED
      *C  QUANTITY UM, NEW PRICE, PRICE UM.  THE PROGRAM WILL EDIT
      *C  THE PO EXISTS, ITEM FOR PO EXISTS, QUANTITY AND PRICE ARE
      *C  NUMERIC, AND THE UNIT OF MEASURES ARE STOREROOM UM OR
      *C  STOREROOM ALTERNATES.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  APRIL 4, 1995    CA ZUBEK    REQ. # 95-009
      *C  ADDED CALLS TO "SPOTRACK" TO WRITE TO THE AUDIT TRAIL FILE
      *C  WHEN UNIT PRICE OR QUANTITY ORDERED IS CHANGED.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  JULY 10, 1995    CA YODER
      *C  ADDED PO ITEM NUMBER FIELD TO PARAMETERS PASSED TO "SPOTRACK."
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  AUGUST 1995      JE COFFMAN  REQ. # 95-030
      *C  ADDED THE ABILITY TO STORE PURCHASE ORDER TRAILER COMMENTS.
      *C  THESE ARE THE 'A' RECORDS THAT ARE SENT FROM CORPORATE TO
      *C  THE PLANT FOR INFORMATION ONLY REGARDING THE PURCHASE ORDER
      *C  (I.E. HOW IT'S TO BE BILLED, PAID, ETC.).
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  DECEMBER 6, 1995   JEFF BUNGO
      *C  CHANGED THE WAY THE PROGRAM WAS GETTING RECORDS FROM BOTH
      *C  DPOITEM AND DPODTAITM.  THE PROGRAM WAS LOOPING THROUGH
      *C  ALL ITEMS OF THE PO TO GET THE CORRECT ITEM.  CHANGED THE
      *C  LOGIC TO GO AFTER THE ITEM DIRECTLY INSTEAD OF LOOPING.
      *C  THIS WAS DONE TO REDUCE THE I/O ON THE TWO FILES WHICH WAS
      *C  ASTRONOMICAL WHEN THE PROGRAM WAS RUN.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN REQ# 6619
      *C  EXPANDED DATE FIELDS FOR COMPLIANCE WITH YEAR 2000.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  JANUARY 21, 1997  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    SKIP EDIT CHECKS OF COMPLETED PO ON PO DELETE FOR
      *C    DELETES DOWNLOADED FOR KELLY PLANTS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  14MAR1997  DAVE PLUM
      *C    CORRECTED THE 99-GETNEXT-DPODATAITM-PO-ITM-O
      *C    PARAGRAPH TO PROPERLY RECOGNIZE WHEN THE "READ NEXT"
      *C    HAS RETRIEVED A RECORD HAVING A KEY GREATER THAN
      *C    THE PO/ITEM THAT WE ARE WORKING WITH.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  24MAR1997  CA YODER
      *C    CORRECTED 6900-PROCESS-TRAILER-COMMENTS TO CHECK FOR THE
      *C    CORRECT CONDITION FOR THE DELETION OF DTRAILER ITEMS.
      *C    PREVIOUSLY, IT WAS PERFORMING THE DELETE UNTIL COND-WORD
      *C    NOT = 15, WHEN IT SHOULD REALLY BE PERFORMED UNTIL COND-WORD
      *C    = 15.  THE DTRAILER COMMENTS WERE NEVER BEING DELETED IF A
      *C    MODIFICATION TO A PO WAS BEING MADE.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  25MAR1997  CA YODER
      *C    CORRECTED 6400-MOD-ITEM PARAGRAPH TO DELETE DPODATAITM
      *C    ENTRIES AFTER THE EDIT CHECKS ON THE PO NUMBER ARE PERFORMED.
      *C    PREVIOUSLY, THE DPODATAITM ENTRIES WERE DELETED BEFORE THE
      *C    THE EDIT CHECKS, SO PURCHASE ORDERS WERE MISSING THE
      *C    DESCRIPTIONS IF AN UPDATE RECORD WAS IN ERROR.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  05MAY1997  CA YODER
      *C    CORRECTED CENTURY LOGIC TO SKIP 'IF YY > "70"' STATEMENT IF
      *C    THE EXPECT OR SHIP DATES ARE EQUAL TO SPACES.  PREVIOUSLY,
      *C    DATES OF "20      " WERE FOUND IN DPORECD.  ALSO, IF THE
      *C    SHIP DATE IS NON-NUMERIC, THE CENTURY LOGIC IS SKIPPED.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  11JUN1997  JE COFFMAN
      *C    CHANGED THE WORKING STORAGE AREAS FOR CODED ITEMS ADDS
      *C    (RECORD TYPE 3 - STR-ITEM-BUFFER) AND NON-STORES ITEM
      *C    ADDS (RECORD TYPE 4 - NS-ITEM-BUFFER) WHEN JUDY FINNEY
      *C    FOUND THAT THE DEPARTMENT AND ADDITIONAL DATA FIELDS WERE
      *C    MISALIGNED.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  05JAN1998  CA YODER
      *C    ADDED FIELDS FOR QUANTITY RECEIVED, INVOICED, AND PAID
      *C    FOR COLLINGWOOD ON THE "3" AND "4" RECORDS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  03/04/1998  CA YODER
      *C    FOUND THAT THE PROGRAM WAS CREATING POS WITH BLANK PO NUMBER.
      *C    CHANGED VALIDATION CHECK TO MAKE SURE PO NUMBER CHARACTERS
      *C    1 - 7 ARE NOT BLANK, NOT ALL 10 CHARACTERS.  WHEN THE RELEASE
      *C    NUMBER CONTAINED "000" THE PROGRAM WAS CREATING THE PO
      *C    ANYWAYS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  04/03/1998  CA YODER
      *C    REMOVED LOGIC TO REPLACE THE FIRST CHARACTER OF A REQ
      *C    WITH AN "N" FOR AKRON PLANTS.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  07/13/1998  CA YODER
      *C    AN ERROR OCCURRED IN PARAGRAPH 6295-DELETE-PO WHEN THE
      *C    RIGHT CONDITIONS EXISTED FOR THE LOGIC TO FALL THROUGH TO
      *C    THE 6298-SET-DELETE-IT PARAGRAPH ERRONEOUSLY.  MOVED THE
      *C    6298 PARAGRAPH OUT OF THE 6295 LOOP.  ALSO ADDED CALL TO
      *C    MCXCBLERR.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  12/08/1999  CA YODER
      *C    ADDED LOGIC FOR AKRON PLANTS TO CHECK IF THE PURCHASE ORDER
      *C    BEING ADDED IS ALREADY IN THE HISTORY DATABASE.  IF IT IS,
      *C    THE PURCHASE ORDER IS SKIPPED AND AN ERROR MESSAGE IS
      *C    PRINTED.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  10/03/2002  CA YODER
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS REQUIRED DATE FIELD FROM CPS.  IT
      *C    IS SENT AS A TYPE "5" RECORD WITH ZEROES FOR THE SEQUENCE
      *C    NUMBER.  IT IS STORED IN DPODATAITM.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  04/03/2003    DCR  DAN RAUCH
      *C  DCR01 - ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *C  03/04/2004    BRUCE GEISER
      *C  BG001 - REMOVE LOGIC TO CREATE TEMP VENDORS.
      **************************************************************

